    "id": "e68b8eaf-48d9-4f9a-86a2-1f7f3fab9e83",
    "name": "FAST - Premium Fashion Storefront Design Challenge (48 hrs)",
    "description": "**CHALLENGE SUMMARY**\nWelcome to the **Premium Fashion Storefront Design Challenge.**\n\nOur client is rebuilding its online store from scratch. In this challenge, we need your creative solution to design the new store, from the home page to the order confirmation. The new design should improve the customer experience and be consistent with the client's brand guidelines.\nPlease read the challenge specifications carefully and let us know if you have any questions in the forums.\n\n**CHALLENGE OBJECTIVES:**\n* Design a new online store for the client, from the home page to the order confirmation.\n* Improve the customer experience of browsing, choosing and buying products.\n* Make the store consistent with the client's brand guidelines.\n\n**ROLLING CHECKPOINT:**\n*Notice this is a FAST single-round challenge but you do need to do some quick research and think about our user!*\n- We will have 5 Rolling Checkpoint Prizes at $50 each.\n\nWe will provide rolling checkpoint feedback to the submissions that are received by Saturday, October 24, 2026 11:45 AM EDT. You can submit any screen(s) that you would like to receive feedback for. You can submit PNG/JPG of your files without the source files included.\n- **Challenge Start:** Friday, October 23, 2026\n- **Rolling Checkpoint Start:** Saturday, October 24, 2026, 11:45 AM EDT.\n- **Final Designs:** Sunday, October 25, 2026, 11:45 AM EDT.\n\n**Notes about Rolling Checkpoint:**\n- PM and Copilot will be available to review early submissions and provide Rolling Checkpoint Feedback.\n- We will answer questions and provide Rolling Feedback as fast as possible.\n- You must watch the Forum for your feedback.\n\n---\n**ROLLING CHECKPOINT REQUIREMENTS**\nSubmit the following screens for checkpoint feedback:\n01) Home\n03) Product Page\n\n**FINAL SUBMISSION REQUIREMENTS**\nSubmit all screens with the checkpoint feedback applied:\n01) Home\n02) Product Listing\n03) Product Page\n04) Cart\n05) Checkout\n06) Order Confirmation\n07) Additional States",
